Z||000000||Jay||08-09-2001||01:50 PM||||okay, so who is going to dragnights August 11,12 2001?  I'll be there on Sunday but I can't make it on Saturday.  It will be held again at Cayuga International dragway just outside of Hamilton Ontario.  It is an import drag day but Fiero's and Cavaliers are invited to attend as well.  Some good cash money up to win or you could just Test and Tune.  I've spoken to several already and there should be quite a good turn out of Fieros, my Northstar a 2.8 intercooled turbo and a 3.4 and 3800SC to name a few.  So, are you coming?<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
